      59.85,
      330.01,
      543.22,
      353.56
    ],
    "text": "FILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE WARD 10 DOWA OF ELLAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A (1) (a) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      229.05,
      354.97,
      374.23,
      366.04
    ],
    "text": "ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.53,
      379.93,
      503.87,
      391.0
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of Member in Ward 10 Dowa of Ella Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason dead;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.53,
      404.89,
      547.7,
      466.12
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna the recognized political party to which Malavige SanjeewaPerera the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66A (1) (a) of the aforesaid Ordinance, to decide upon themember of that Ward 10 Dowa of Ella Pradeshiya Sabha who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section 9of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared elected as a Member within a period of thirty (30)days;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.53,
      480.01,
      547.54,
      503.56
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision to nominate AttanayakaMudiyanselage Hemawathie Kumarihamy to fill such vacancy:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.53,
      517.45,
      547.62,
      553.48
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE I, H. I. R. Hathurusinghe Returning Officer of Ella Pradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of Section 66A (1) (a)of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that Attanayaka Mudiyanselage HemawathieKumarihamy was elected as the Member of the Ward 10 Dowa of Ella Pradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      396.09,
      567.13,
      489.07,
      578.2
    ],
    "text": "H. I. R. HATHURUSINGHE,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      397.53,
